# A BUILD OUTPUT, NOT A COMMITTED FILE - the same rule Sessions.exe follows.
# The self-contained publish is 68 MB; committing it would put that in history
# for ever, on every rebuild, for a file that src\build.ps1 reproduces.
#
#     powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File src\build.ps1 -Publish
*
!.gitignore
